    }
  ],
  "explanation": "The Builder drafts the comprehensive integration strategy. The Local Context & Regulatory Refiner enriches it with country-specific regulatory and cultural details. An IF gate (Strategic Completeness Reviewer) validates coverage of all markets and pillars; if gaps are found, it routes back to the Refiner for corrections. A Risk & Feasibility Analyst then stress-tests the strategy, and the Risk-Integration Refiner weaves mitigations into the plan. A WHILE gate (Strategic Coherence Validator) checks for internal consistency and board readiness, looping back to the Risk-Integration Refiner up to 3 times if needed. Finally, the Executive Strategy Polisher produces a user-facing, board-ready document."
